<section class="summer-fit-dark">
	<div class="summer-wrap">
		<h2>Is YSA Summer Right for Your Child?</h2>
		<div class="summer-grid-2">
			<article class="summer-fit-card good">
				<h3>Great fit for...</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>Kids who have "intense" niche interests (from transit maps to deep sea biology).</li>
					<li>Students who feel bored or "different" in traditional school settings.</li>
					<li>2e (Twice Exceptional) learners who need both challenge and support.</li>
					<li>Parents looking for an inclusive, high-level social community.</li>
				</ul>
			</article>
			<article class="summer-fit-card bad">
				<h3>May not be the right fit for...</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>Kids who prefer passive, lecture-style learning without interaction.</li>
					<li>Families looking for 8-hour childcare or non-interactive "edu-tainment."</li>
					<li>Students who do not have a reliable internet connection or device.</li>
					<li>Families who require strictly offline, physical-only experiences.</li>
				</ul>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
